---
// ThinkingStyles — Collapsible dropdown cards showing ways of thinking
import Container from "./Container.astro";
---

<section class="section">
  <Container>
    <h2
      class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center animate-in"
      style="color: var(--fg);"
    >
      Plusieurs façons de penser.
    </h2>
    <p
      class="mt-4 text-center text-base sm:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto animate-in"
      style="color: var(--fg-secondary); --delay: 0.1s;"
    >
      Nous ne sommes pas qu'un seul profil. Chaque projet mobilise différentes
      facettes de notre approche créative.
    </p>

    <div class="ts-list mt-12">
      <!-- 01 Design Thinking -->
      <details class="ts-item animate-in" style="--delay: 0.15s;">
        <summary class="ts-summary">
          <div class="ts-summary-left">
            <div class="ts-icon">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 19V5M5 12l7-7 7 7"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ts-text">
              <span class="ts-tag">01</span>
              <span class="ts-title">Design Thinking</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <svg class="ts-chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="ts-body">
          <p>Placer l'humain au centre. Observer, empathiser, prototyper rapidement. Valider avant de construire.</p>
          <div class="ts-keywords">
            <span>Empathie</span><span>Wireframe</span><span>Test</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- 02 Pensée Stratégique -->
      <details class="ts-item animate-in" style="--delay: 0.25s;">
        <summary class="ts-summary">
          <div class="ts-summary-left">
            <div class="ts-icon">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M2 20h20M5 20V8l7-6 7 6v12M9 20v-6h6v6"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ts-text">
              <span class="ts-tag">02</span>
              <span class="ts-title">Pensée Stratégique</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <svg class="ts-chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="ts-body">
          <p>Comprendre le marché, la concurrence, les objectifs business. Chaque choix visuel a un impact mesurable.</p>
          <div class="ts-keywords">
            <span>Positionnement</span><span>Objectifs</span><span>Métriques</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- 03 Créativité Visuelle -->
      <details class="ts-item animate-in" style="--delay: 0.35s;">
        <summary class="ts-summary">
          <div class="ts-summary-left">
            <div class="ts-icon">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ts-text">
              <span class="ts-tag">03</span>
              <span class="ts-title">Créativité Visuelle</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <svg class="ts-chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="ts-body">
          <p>Explorer des directions inattendues. Typographie, couleur, composition — chaque pixel raconte une histoire.</p>
          <div class="ts-keywords">
            <span>Identité</span><span>Typo</span><span>Composition</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- 04 Approche Technique -->
      <details class="ts-item animate-in" style="--delay: 0.45s;">
        <summary class="ts-summary">
          <div class="ts-summary-left">
            <div class="ts-icon">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ts-text">
              <span class="ts-tag">04</span>
              <span class="ts-title">Approche Technique</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <svg class="ts-chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="ts-body">
          <p>Code propre et performant. Accessibilité, responsive, optimisation — la beauté ne s'arrête pas au maquettage.</p>
          <div class="ts-keywords">
            <span>Accessibilité</span><span>Performance</span><span>Clean code</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- 05 Collaboration -->
      <details class="ts-item animate-in" style="--delay: 0.55s;">
        <summary class="ts-summary">
          <div class="ts-summary-left">
            <div class="ts-icon">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ts-text">
              <span class="ts-tag">05</span>
              <span class="ts-title">Collaboration</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <svg class="ts-chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="ts-body">
          <p>Un projet réussi est un projet partagé. Communication transparente, retours itératifs, co-création avec l'équipe client.</p>
          <div class="ts-keywords">
            <span>Ateliers</span><span>Retours</span><span>Co-création</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>

<style>
  .ts-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .ts-item {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: none;
    background: var(--bg);
    transition: border-color 0.3s;
  }
  .ts-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .ts-item[open] {
    border-color: var(--border-hover);
  }
  .ts-item[open] + .ts-item {
    border-top-color: var(--border-hover);
  }

  .ts-summary {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    user-select: none;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .ts-summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .ts-summary::marker { display: none; content: ""; }
  .ts-summary:hover {
    background: var(--bg-raised);
  }

  .ts-summary-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .ts-icon {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--fg-secondary);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: color 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
  }
  .ts-item[open] .ts-icon {
    color: var(--fg);
    border-color: var(--border-hover);
  }

  .ts-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.125rem;
  }

  .ts-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.5625rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .ts-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .ts-chevron {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    transition: transform 0.3s var(--ease-out-expo);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .ts-item[open] .ts-chevron {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }

  .ts-body {
    padding: 0 1.25rem 1.25rem 3.5rem;
    animation: ts-dropdown-in 0.3s var(--ease-out-expo);
  }
  .ts-body p {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--fg-secondary);
  }

  .ts-keywords {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.375rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }
  .ts-keywords span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.5625rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }

  @keyframes ts-dropdown-in {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-8px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .ts-summary {
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    }
    .ts-body {
      padding: 0 1rem 1rem 2.75rem;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ts-body { animation: none; }
    .ts-chevron { transition: none; }
  }
</style>
